{
  "dsl": "octos.lesson",
  "version": "0.1",
  "profile": "authoring",
  "lesson": {
    "mode": "explain",
    "language": "zh-CN",
    "title": "竖直直线的斜率：为什么不是 0？",
    "goals": [
      "分清水平直线与竖直直线在两坐标变化量上的本质区别",
      "理解竖直线 x=2 导致除以零，因此斜率不存在"
    ],
    "adaptation": {
      "strategies": [
        "坦率修正误解，认可学生的敏锐质疑",
        "通过逐步比较变化量 Δx 和 Δy，从斜率定义直接找出分歧"
      ]
    },
    "reflections": [
      {
        "as": "section-01-reflection-01",
        "prompt": "如果一条直线的倾斜角从 0° 逐渐增大逼近 90°，它的斜率变化趋势是怎样的？为什么恰好在 90° 时无法定义斜率？",
        "answer": "当倾斜角逼近 90° 时，Δx 越来越接近 0，比值 k = Δy / Δx 绝对值无限增大；恰好到达 90°（竖直）时，Δx = 0，产生了除以零的算式，因此无法定义数值斜率。",
        "anchor": "section-01-moment-03-item-01",
        "availability": {
          "kind": "after_lesson"
        }
      },
      {
        "as": "section-02-reflection-01",
        "prompt": "如果一条直线的方程是 x = -5，它的斜率是多少？为什么不能说它的斜率是 0 或无穷大？",
        "answer": "斜率不存在。因为在直线 x = -5 上任取两点，横坐标变化量 Δx 始终为 0，斜率公式的分母为 0，除以 0 在实数运算中无定义；斜率为 0 对应水平直线，而无穷大不是实数斜率值，因此规范表述必须是“斜率不存在”。",
        "anchor": "section-02-moment-04-item-01",
        "availability": {
          "kind": "after_lesson"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "key": "section-01",
      "purpose": "纠正‘竖直线斜率为0’的误解，建立水平线与竖直线的变化量对比",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "你说得很对，竖直直线的斜率确实不是 0。这是一个值得收藏的问题，我们直接用斜率的定义来对比清楚。",
          "delivery": "encouraging",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "opening-title",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "竖直直线的斜率：为什么不是 0？",
                "items": [
                  "本课导入"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region"
              },
              "when": "before_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "expression",
              "expression": "neutral",
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "我们先比较两个变化量：水平直线上，横坐标可以任意改变，而纵坐标的变化量始终是 0，算出的比值才是 0。",
          "delivery": "careful",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-02-item-01",
              "kind": "plot",
              "role": "main_visual",
              "content": {
                "title": "水平直线 y=0*x+2",
                "axes": {
                  "x": {
                    "min": -4,
                    "max": 4,
                    "label": "x"
                  },
                  "y": {
                    "min": -0.5,
                    "max": 2.5,
                    "label": "y"
                  }
                },
                "curves": [
                  {
                    "as": "primary-curve",
                    "expression": "((0)*(x))+(2)",
                    "label": "y = 2 (斜率为0)"
                  }
                ],
                "points": [
                  {
                    "as": "reference-a",
                    "x": 0,
                    "y": 2,
                    "label": "A"
                  },
                  {
                    "as": "reference-b",
                    "x": 1,
                    "y": 2,
                    "label": "B"
                  }
                ],
                "bindings": [
                  {
                    "target": "reference-a.y",
                    "expression": "((0)*(0))+(2)"
                  },
                  {
                    "target": "reference-b.y",
                    "expression": "((0)*(1))+(2)"
                  }
                ],
                "measurement": "secant",
                "sample_input": "fixed_x"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region",
                "region_role": "section-01"
              },
              "when": "before_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-02-item-02",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "k = \\frac{\\Delta y}{\\Delta x} = \\frac{y_2 - y_1}{x_2 - x_1}"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-02-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "point",
              "target": "section-01-moment-02-item-01",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-03",
          "say": "但对竖直线来说，任何两点的横坐标都完全相同，导致分母上的横坐标变化量等于 0。除以零在算术中没有定义，所以直线 x=2 的斜率不存在，而不是 0。",
          "delivery": "emphatic",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-03-item-01",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "两类特殊直线的斜率区别",
                "items": [
                  "水平线 (y = c)：Δy = 0，Δx ≠ 0，斜率 k = 0",
                  "竖直线 (x = 2)：Δx = 0，分母为 0 无意义，斜率不存在"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-02-item-02"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "point",
              "target": "section-01-moment-02-item-01",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "section-02",
      "purpose": "以直线 x=2 具体计算两点变化量，明确除以零导致斜率不存在",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "你敏锐地指出了上一节的关键：直线 x=2 的斜率到底是多少？我们直接在直线 x=2 上任取两个不同的点，比如 (2, 1) 和 (2, 4)，用斜率定义一步步比较变化量。",
          "delivery": "encouraging",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-02-moment-01-item-01",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "直线上任取两点",
                "items": [
                  "直线方程：x = 2",
                  "点 A: (2, 1)",
                  "点 B: (2, 4)"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-02-item-01"
              },
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "我们先比较两个变化量：纵坐标从 1 变成 4，纵向变化量 Δy 等于 3；但横坐标始终固定为 2，横向变化量 Δx 等于 2 减 2，也就是 0。",
          "delivery": "patient",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-02-moment-02-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "\\Delta y = 4 - 1 = 3,\\quad \\Delta x = 2 - 2 = 0"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-02-moment-01-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-02-item-01",
                "section-02-moment-02-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "聚焦在分母横坐标变化量为0",
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-03",
          "say": "斜率的定义是 Δy 比上 Δx。代入进来，式子变成了 3 除以 0。但在数学中，除数绝对不能为 0，这个比值根本没有定义。",
          "delivery": "careful",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-02-moment-03-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "k = \\frac{\\Delta y}{\\Delta x} = \\frac{3}{0} \\quad (\\text{除以 } 0 \\text{ 无意义，斜率不存在})"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-02-moment-02-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "point",
              "target": "section-01-moment-02-item-01",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-04",
          "say": "所以直接给出确切结论：直线 x=2 的斜率不是 0，而是不存在。斜率为 0 属于水平直线，而像 x=2 这样的所有竖直直线，它们的斜率都是不存在的。",
          "delivery": "emphatic",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-02-moment-04-item-01",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "斜率本质对比",
                "items": [
                  "水平直线：Δy = 0, Δx ≠ 0 → 斜率为 0",
                  "竖直直线 (x=2)：Δx = 0, 分母为 0 → 斜率不存在"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-02-moment-03-item-01"
              },
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "close": {
    "summary": "水平直线的 Δy=0，斜率是 0；竖直直线（如 x=2）的 Δx=0，导致分母为 0，因此斜率不存在，而不是 0。",
    "focus": [
      "section-01-moment-02-item-01"
    ]
  }
}
